{"ticker":"CF","updated":"2026-11-13T22:52:38Z","profile":{"longName":"CF Industries Holdings, Inc.","shortName":"CF Industries Holdings, Inc.","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Agricultural Inputs","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cfindustries.com","fullTimeEmployees":2900,"marketCap":18298779648,"trailingPE":8.821579,"forwardPE":10.691152,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.3046322,"pegRatio":0.52,"targetMeanPrice":129.636,"targetHighPrice":195.72,"targetLowPrice":105.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.121,"earningsGrowth":0.311,"grossMargins":0.42519,"operatingMargins":0.38489,"profitMargins":0.27481002,"totalRevenue":7939999744,"beta":0.541,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":141.96,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":75.42,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.92},"summary":"CF Industries Holdings, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the production of ammonia in North America, Europe, and internationally. It operates through Ammonia, Granular Urea, UAN, AN, and Other segments. The company offers ammonia products; nitrogen products, such as granular urea, urea ammonium nitrate solution, and ammonium nitrate; diesel exhaust fluid, urea liquor, and nitric acid products. It serves cooperatives, retailers, independent fertilizer distributors, traders, wholesalers, and industrial users. The company was founded in 1946 and is headquartered in Northbrook, Illinois.","summary_zh":"CF Industries Holdings, Inc. 及其子公司在北美、歐洲和國際上從事氨生產。它透過氨、顆粒尿素、UAN、AN 和其他部門運作。該公司提供氨產品；氮產品，如顆粒尿素、尿素硝酸銨溶液、硝酸銨；柴油引擎廢氣處理液、尿素液、硝酸產品。它為合作社、零售商、獨立肥料經銷商、貿易商、批發商和工業用戶提供服務。該公司成立於 1946 年，總部位於伊利諾伊州諾斯布魯克。","sector_zh":"基礎材料","industry_zh":"農業投入","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":85.84,"h":86.1,"l":85.04,"c":85.35,"v":2287200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":85.97,"h":86.27,"l":84.65,"c":84.96,"v":2600900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":84.81,"h":85.4,"l":84.08,"c":84.19,"v":2269700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":84.52,"h":84.8,"l":83.14,"c":84.1,"v":2793900},{"t":"